!Name: LG46_GL
!CGliderless p46 LWSS gun
!C
!CThis gun is composed of two different p46 factories which manufacture pre-traffic
!Clights. The pre-TLs react to form a LWSS which flies away in time to clear the site
!Cfor the next production cycle. At the time of this writing (June 1998) this is the
!Csmallest gliderless p46 LWSS gun known. For a use of this gun see the pattern
!CLG8280.LIF.
!C
!CDieter Leithner, 29 Mar 1998
!Source: Life-DL-98
!
